## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)
vi-a #1, the deletion of digit 10. The reviewer is right that `pcode=G0340028&flno=3` is Article 3 of 各類所得扣繳率標準 and that "(nhãn nguồn: Điều 10)" must not be the citation the reader sees. The suggested link text drops the digit 10 that the Korean source still has on this line (`영업세법 제10조`). Round 3 showed that deletion fails the checker (`numbers FAIL missing from translation (1): 10`). The public label now says the link is Điều 3 and is not Điều 10 of the business-tax act, which keeps the digit.

vi-a #4, adding "(2020)" beside ROC year 109 on the other two judgments. ACCEPTED-ROUND forbids adding a Gregorian year. Số 644 already had "(2020)"; số 477 and số 236 did not receive one. The terminology fix was applied.

